cff-version: 1.2.0
title: RNA-seq Preprocessing Pipeline - Conda (Mus musculus)

message: >
If you use this pipeline in your research, please cite it using the
information below. This workflow processes single-end and paired-end
RNA-seq data using Snakemake, Singularity, STAR, fastp, RSeQC,
samtools, and MultiQC on SLURM-based HPC systems.

